[S01] accepted but not yet completed
[S03] action error part-way
[S04] cancelled externally
[S05] caller deadline passes before completion
[S06] status polling lost after acceptance
[S07] invocation unknown to the server (404)
[S08] status returns after the client gave up
[S09] adapter crash during an outstanding action
[S10] gateway restart with an unresolved action
[S11] duplicate requests
[S12] stale readback served by an intermediary (stamp=received, readback_skew_ms=0)
[S12-date] stale readback served by an intermediary (stamp=date_header, readback_skew_ms=1000)
[S04b] cancel request on an action that ignores it (direct LabThings)
[S12b] stale reading used to reconcile (stamp=received, readback_skew_ms=0)
[S12b-date] stale reading used to reconcile (stamp=date_header, readback_skew_ms=1000)
[S12c] Date-header stamping, uncached, readback_skew_ms=1000
